## Notes: Modular preferences addon for various WoW quality-of-life features
## Author: Jarrot
## Version: @project-version@
## SavedVariables: TokukoPDB
## OptionalDeps: ElvUI, EllesmereUI

# Libraries (LibStub keeps only the newest copy across addons)
